    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Traces",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Traces for the API (`ledgerline-api`: HTTP and database spans) and the queue worker (`ledgerline-worker`: claim, handler, ack with job id and attempt) are in Jaeger: http://localhost:16686. Spans never carry API keys, tenant ids or SQL text."
      }
